                                                "sense_id": "9a02541a-4f68-3124-864c-58ee79061cd5",
                                                "text": "[L]astly he made a bindle in a plastic tarp of some cans of juice and cans of fruit and cans of vegetables […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3eb5a35e-5a69-3e22-b415-4d8065c7b619",
